%% TRIP-037 Booking agent for finding and cancelling a booking
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor asks for help with a booking] --> B[Hjälp mig: R1]
    B --> C[show_my_booking opens /min-bokning]
    C --> D[Visitor types number and last name in the page and presses Visa min bokning: R2]
    D --> E{Found?}
    E -- no --> F[Same answer, 5 wrong in 15 minutes lock it: TECH-026]
    F --> D
    E -- yes --> G[Each question carries the extract, no names: R4]
    G --> H[She explains the rules: R3]
    H --> I[tick_cancellation: R5]
    I --> J{Can the part be cancelled?}
    J -- no --> K[Not ticked, she says why]
    J -- yes --> L[Chat asks the page to tick, announced: R6]
    L --> M[Visitor presses Avboka and Ja, avboka]
    M --> N[cancelAction: checks, draw, saved, as today]
